{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-06_end","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-06","title":"捉迷藏","storyCode":"9-7","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"7860ef5ef1ab7d11f67fa5a18c8c63066fe06219f583f8410ac4d37b9c63c379","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"隨著爆炸發生，深池部隊在“領袖”帶領下大肆反攻，參與集會的人傷亡慘重。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，你沒事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。倒是你，幸虧這回沒往前撲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長的反應比我更快，至少盾後這片大廳基本都是好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我護不住所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"煙散得差不多了，我看到上校也只受了輕傷，他們正從另一個門撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"詩人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，他站得離炸彈太近了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好可惜，不是每個人都能頂著刀刃替別人站出來的。他雖然是個詩人，但他有不輸給優秀戰士的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我多麼希望他的死不是毫無意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁敵人還沒打進來，風笛，疏散倖存者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風笛呆呆地看著窗外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_I3"},{"type":"narration","text":"有那麼一刻，交戰聲都彷彿消失了。\n一股巨大的能量自黑夜深處迸開。\n火並沒有真的燒起來，從雕像到市政廳，一切活物都在瞬間無聲地化作了灰燼。\n緊接著，一支軍隊悄無聲息地從黑夜和灰燼裡滲了出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_manorindoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來沒見過......這樣的火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"領頭的術師，她是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，快走遠一些！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你站得離窗太近了。以剛才的能量來看，下一擊能直接炸穿牆體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"幫我......快幫幫我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿......好疼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救人要緊。先撤退。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？附近還有活著的維多利亞士兵？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敵人到處都是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......以這個行軍速度來看，鬼魂部隊早就滲透進這座城市裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十一區到十七區的淪陷速度太快了......難道說......這就是上校要去這些街區搜查的原因？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們必須撤去第十區以南。駐軍正在那個方位和鬼魂部隊交戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別去戰場，先......先送我回到安全的地方躲一躲......不能讓頭領們發現我還活著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送你回去？現在來看，你真的該被送進監獄！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"輕一點......嗚......疼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我給你們錢......我甚至可以送你們一個街區......只要你們......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......隊長，我能不能用我的法子讓他閉嘴？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趁他醒著，多問幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才那個領頭的術師是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"......那是......領袖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼魂部隊的領袖？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她......到底是什麼身份？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是一夥的嗎？你什麼都不知道就敢把人領進家門？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"她是......公爵的客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公爵？哪一個？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"野心勃勃的男爵","speakerId":"avg_npc_177","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他......死了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬼魂部隊動的手......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不是一夥的嗎？鬼魂部隊怎麼專挑自己人下手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......先離開這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你，站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"你是什麼人？躲在這裡幹什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我那個......我本來只是送個藥......誰知你們打起來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"送藥？給誰送？給維多利亞士兵？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"我......呵呵......羅德島的藥，是給感染者用的，我們不關心病人的身份......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"深池士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_244","isRemote":false,"text":"行跡可疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事了，威爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"Outcast女士！您、您來得太及時了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你收到下午的通訊了吧？羅德島將緊急停止在小丘郡的一切日常業務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"收是收到了，但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——想把剩下的藥送完？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是個好孩子。先把藥給我吧，剩下的我替你送。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"女士，外面到底怎麼回事？一眨眼，到處都在打仗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"累積了數百年的仇怨被人利用，成了一把試圖摧毀一切的火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這才剛剛開始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你趕緊回去吧。既然我在這裡，我最優先要確保的，就是我們羅德島的人，一個都不能少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，女士......對了，我剛才在十七區附近還見到了簡小姐......她......她經常來辦事處，我們都當她是半個羅德島幹員！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員威爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_090","isRemote":false,"text":"她是維多利亞士兵，看這群暴徒的意思，他們不會放過她的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我修改下剛才那句話——羅德島的人，半個都不能少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，能轉移的人都轉移了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好。你有沒有受傷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。這一夜交手下來，我算是放心了一點。除了那個領頭的術師，還有幾個厲害角色，剩下的大多數士兵還是普通人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是受過一些訓練，但紀律說不上好。如果人數相當，正面碰上的話，不會是我們小隊的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也說了前提。而且，他們的主要對手是駐軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，你說得對，要和他們打的話，駐軍占不到上風。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有沒有什麼發現？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的武器裝備都很精良。我剛剛去救那幾個官員和貴族的時候，有人想從拐角處偷襲我，被我敲暈以後，我從他手裡拿了這個回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞制式軍弩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是兩年前的型號，不過有改裝，你看這兩個線圈和下面的導軌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是破盾彈加速裝置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對弩不是很在行，隊長，我沒在軍隊和學校裡見過這個。這是我們的技術嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，我是不是遺漏了什麼......我們是來調查源石製品失竊案的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，毫無疑問，鬼魂部隊想和我們正規軍抗衡，就一定需要大量武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我們手上這把弩透露了很多資訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，敵人暗中謀劃的時間比我們想得更久；其次，除了從我們手裡搶過去的物資，另外有勢力在長期資助他們的行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，這一回，在這裡，他們並沒有打算拿上新裝備就匆匆上陣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對哦！這麼說的話，最近這批丟了的武器去了哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也發現了問題所在——鬼魂部隊終於現身，可消失在小丘郡的源石製品，到現在都沒有露面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望三角鐵找到了一些新的線索。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）我在，隊長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們小組現在還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小鼓受了點傷，其他人都還能行動，就是大家都又累又餓，狀態肯定沒那麼好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們昨天也參與戰鬥了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的。昨天傍晚開始，突然有大量敵人湧了出來，他們就跟一直埋伏在大棚和灌溉系統裡似的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來這就是他們之前的藏身之地了。不熟悉農用地塊的駐軍，很難贏下這場捉迷藏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們和其中一小波打了個照面，我看敵人實在太多，就帶人躲了起來，直到天亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做得很好。能回城裡來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，隊長，有點困難。他們中的一半進了城，另一半仍然到處都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我們小組一致認為，我們應該繼續最初的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們查到了一輛運輸車，你猜得沒錯，確實有人在利用農產品運輸路線把這批源石製品運往某個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每次都不算多，今天這些很可能是最後一批。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天這些？你們在哪裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在就藏在運輸車上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，我不敢說太多，怕他們聽見。下次聯絡，你就知道到底誰是小偷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這太冒險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......隊長，你和風笛也要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角鐵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"三角鐵，通訊完畢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風笛，馬上通知大提琴，我們這就回軍營。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"narration","text":"“......第三到第九城區失守......”\n“......市政廳、報社、瑪麗醫院同時遭到敵人攻擊......”\n“......波萊男爵的夫人發來急電，她的丈夫於凌晨後失聯，她請求駐軍施以援手......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上校！我有話要說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓她進來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你不是來說廢話的，斯卡曼德羅斯。如你所見，我們的敵人十分猖狂，我沒空再和你爭辯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校，敵人躲在農用地塊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們之前就藏在那裡。而且，現在在城裡的也不是全部，他們還有更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我建議您馬上派人去農用地塊撤離平民，並儘快實施中央城區和農用地塊的緊急脫鉤，以免讓更多敵人進入城區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用你教我怎麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校！僅憑駐軍兵力和我們突擊隊的人，對付滲透進城內的敵軍都未必能很快取得勝利，我們必須確保敵人不會再有援軍——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何保住小丘郡是我的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在捍衛維多利亞國土安全這件首要任務上，我們該站在一起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希爾，送客。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G2_opera_room"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到了嗎，希爾？農用地塊，哈，他們藏在農用地塊！我早該想到了，還有誰會給鬼魂開門？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，上校，塔拉人在幫他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炮兵營準備得如何了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"按計劃，最後一批原料會在中午左右送達。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你讓他們加緊改造。只要一想到令人作嘔的東西正在我的城市裡蹦躂，我就一秒鐘都不想多等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，還有斯卡曼德羅斯和她的手下，倫蒂尼姆來的狼還死死咬著不放。你都聽見了吧？他們有人在外面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吩咐下去，不管採取什麼手段，都不能讓任何人妨礙到我們的計畫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"是，上校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於斯卡曼德羅斯，在事成之前，也不能放任她自由行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......被她這麼一說，我倒是想到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼我們昨夜在波頓家的行動會被敵人提前知道？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡曼德羅斯......不，不會的。這人雖然和那類貴族一樣天真又軟弱，但她對帝國的忠誠很有保障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"副官希爾","speakerId":"avg_npc_248","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......看來渣滓終究是渣滓，卑劣的天性始終難改。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"漢密爾頓上校","speakerId":"avg_npc_227_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這最後的幾個小時裡，還有件早該完成的事情必須完成。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
